        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 24,
        "verse": 13
      },
      {
        "text": "The murderer rising with the light killeth the poor and needy, and in the night is as a thief.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 14,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 24:14",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 24,
        "verse": 14
      },
      {
        "text": "The eye also of the adulterer waiteth for the twilight, saying, No eye shall see me: and disguiseth his face.",
